  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Dinosaurs lived millions of years ago."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "They ruled for 150 million years."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "Movies often show dinosaurs as giant, scary lizards."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "But real dinosaurs actually looked quite different."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "Many dinosaurs looked more like birds than lizards."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "Take the velociraptor, for example."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "In movies, this dinosaur looks bigger than a person."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "Its claws and teeth look long and sharp."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "But, in fact, velociraptors were not that big or that scary."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "They were about the size of a turkey."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "And they were also covered in feathers."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "They didn’t look scary at all."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
